<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport" />
  <title>{{appName}} - Vos identifiants</title>
  <style>
    /* Using your exact CSS variables and resets */
    :root {
      --primary: #F97316;
      --bg: #F9FAFB;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #111827;
      --muted: #6B7280;
      --card-radius: 12px;
    }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .email-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: var(--card-radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);
    }

    .header {
      padding: 28px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF7ED 0%, #ffffff 60%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    }

    .logo {
      display: inline-block;
      height: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F97316, #EC4899, #A855F7);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 28px 36px;
    }

    .activation-box {
      background: #FFF7ED;
      border: 1px solid rgba(254, 215, 170, 0.6);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .user-name {
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    footer {
      background: #030712;
      color: #9CA3AF;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-logo img {
      height: 30px;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="email-container">
  <div class="header">
    <img src="https://nufisms.com/assets/images/dark.png" alt="{{appName}}" class="logo" />
    <h1>Vos accès sur <span class="gradient-text">{{appName}}</span></h1>
    <p style="color: var(--muted);">Votre compte administrateur a été configuré.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p>Bonjour <span class="user-name">{{userName}}</span>,</p>
    <p>Un administrateur vous a créé un compte. Voici vos identifiants de connexion sécurisés :</p>

    <div class="activation-box">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Email :</strong> {{userEmail}}</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><strong>Mot de passe :</strong> <span style="color: var(--primary); font-family: monospace; font-size: 18px;">{{generatedPassword}}</span></p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);">Par mesure de sécurité, nous vous demandons de changer ce mot de passe dès votre première connexion.</p>
      <a class="cta-button" href="{{loginUrl}}">Se connecter à mon compte</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <img src="https://nufisms.com/assets/images/dark.png" alt="{{appName}}" />
    </div>
    <p>© {{year}} {{appName}}. Tous droits réservés.</p>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>